        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "Frequency once per round\n\n---\nEffect Voulgarghas sings charming pleasantries from one of their four mouths to a single target within 30 feet. The target takes 10d6 cold damage and must attempt a DC 44 Will save save.\n\n---\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The creature takes half damage and is Stupefied 1 for 1 round.\n\nFailure The creature takes full damage, gains weakness 10 to cold, and is stupefied 1 for 1 minute.\n\nCritical Failure The creature takes double damage, gains weakness 15 to cold, and is Stupefied 2 for 1 minute.",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Mental Synergy",
      "actions": "free",
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "spellshape"
      ],
      "text": "Frequency once per minute\n\nRequirements The bdellavritra is possessing a host using Mind Worm\n\n---\nEffect If the bdellavritra's next action is to Cast a Spell, they reduce the number of actions to cast it by 1 (minimum 1 action).",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "PT1M"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Mind Worm",
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "incapacitation",
        "mental",
        "possession"
      ],
      "text": "The bdellavritra spends 10 minutes adjacent to an Unconscious or willing living creature, then attempts to possess its body. This functions as Possession heightened to 9th rank (DC 37 Will save save), except that it has a duration of 1 month. If affected, the host receives new saving throws only at the start of each day. If the host dies, the bdellavritra must attempt a Fortitude save as normal but is only Stunned 2 on a failure (or Stunned 4 on a critical failure)."
    },
